- op: discuss  # 8fae
  at: '2026-11-13T04:36:33Z'  # 8fae
  by: agent  # 8fae
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 8fae
  clock: 4  # 8fae
  nonce: 8fae  # 8fae
  message: "Merged in PR #2161. smart-test narrows by default (--no-narrow opts out) and the narrowing block runs above the manifest snapshot, so merge CI runs the narrowed set; the header says '# Narrowed: N'. Behavioural evidence: this PR's own manifest was the first narrowed one ('# Narrowed: 2 test file(s) removed', 216 files), and the local run printed 'Coverage narrowing removed 2 test file(s)'. full-suite.yml never reads the manifest (pinned by test_the_full_suite_cron_never_reads_the_manifest). Also fixed: narrow no longer drops a changed test file (probe: changed test_selection_narrow.py was dropped before, kept after; test_a_changed_test_file_is_never_dropped)."  # 8fae
